#: ../../../watchdog/npcm_wdt.rst:5
msgid "NPCM Watchdog"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../watchdog/npcm_wdt.rst:7
msgid ""
"The NPCM watchdog driver can report reset-cause information on ``nuvoton,"
"npcm750-wdt`` and ``nuvoton,npcm845-wdt`` systems."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../watchdog/npcm_wdt.rst:10
msgid ""
"Userspace can read the latched reset cause through ``WDIOC_GETBOOTSTATUS``. "
"When ``CONFIG_WATCHDOG_SYSFS`` is enabled, the same value is also visible "
"through ``/sys/class/watchdog/watchdogN/bootstatus``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../watchdog/npcm_wdt.rst:14
msgid ""
"The mapping is fixed in the driver. It exposes the SoC reset indications "
"through the generic watchdog bootstatus flags and is not configurable from "
"Device Tree."
msgstr ""

